    "description": {
      "content": "Discover quantum devices available on Amazon Braket — QPUs from AQT, IonQ, IQM, QuEra, and Rigetti, plus AWS-managed on-demand simulators (SV1, DM1, TN1). Use GetDevice to retrieve provider capabilities, paradigm, queue state, native gate set, and topology for a single ARN; use SearchDevices to enumerate devices by status, provider, and type.\n\n\nContact Support:\n Name: AWS Support",
